The factory wiring in qairt_score_worker.cpp is adapted from
https://github.com/qualcomm/geniex-qairt-plugin at
f00a37cd50645456c8fbf0eaf179fa59640fd5bf (models/qwen3_vl/qwen3_vl.cpp).

The fixed processor's image layout and token-splicing conventions follow
https://github.com/qualcomm/geniex-proc at
2ec6abcac6db8473fa26ea2f882f99652723cc7b (src/processors/qwen2vl.cpp).
Its STB decoder is included at build time from that pinned checkout, retaining
the upstream stb_image.h public-domain/MIT license in the dependency.

